{"data": [{"author_id": "1955648334716432384", "created_at": "2026-10-29T04:30:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115662536150593940"], "id": "2115662536150593940", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 100, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "moody’s giving rlusd an a2 rating right after the occ approval.\nphone at 3% and i’m still reading about bank reserves in bed 😶", "url": "https://x.com/kimmese_eth/status/2115662536150593940"}, {"author_id": "2111249773386690560", "created_at": "2026-10-29T01:01:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115609832958906618"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Your premier destination for military and international security information. Stay current on issues shaping our world. Explore our in-depth country guides and comprehensive coverage of militaries and weapon systems around the globe. Get Full Access to GlobalSecurity.org's Ad-free Premium Content In-depth coverage of conflicts, genocide and security alliances Your privacy and preferences are important to us. As part of our ongoing effort to remain open and transparent, we have updated our Privacy Policy", "display_url": "GlobalSecurity.org", "end": 159, "expanded_url": "https://GlobalSecurity.org", "start": 136, "status": 200, "title": "GlobalSecurity.org - Reliable News and Security Information", "unwound_url": "https://GlobalSecurity.org", "url": "https://t.co/BMYwWKZj5W"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/eBQ0ZEk0Oe", "end": 253, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/UkraineEvidence/status/2115609832958906618/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115609831021154304", "start": 230, "url": "https://t.co/eBQ0ZEk0Oe"}]}, "id": "2115609832958906618", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 354, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📉 Russia's economy under the war: Immobilised Russian central bank reserves (G7/EU) — 300 USD billion (approx.)\nsince Feb 2022. Source: https://t.co/BMYwWKZj5W compilation of EU/press data\nSources and the full record: link in bio https://t.co/eBQ0ZEk0Oe", "url": "https://x.com/UkraineEvidence/status/2115609832958906618"}, {"author_id": "1892474210951581697", "created_at": "2026-10-29T02:12:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115627866797093022"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 252, "start": 246, "tag": "Forex"}, {"end": 268, "start": 253, "tag": "MonetaryPolicy"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/XgZngB2rOw", "end": 292, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/mcmarketsX/status/2115627866797093022/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115627795795591168", "start": 269, "url": "https://t.co/XgZngB2rOw"}]}, "id": "2115627866797093022", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "When a central bank buys foreign currency with its own money, bank reserves rise. It can absorb those reserves by selling securities or issuing bills. This is sterilised intervention. \n\nThe FX purchase stays; its liquidity injection is offset. \n\n#Forex #MonetaryPolicy https://t.co/XgZngB2rOw", "url": "https://x.com/mcmarketsX/status/2115627866797093022"}, {"author_id": "1915877300543115264", "created_at": "2026-10-28T21:27:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115555964657291716"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/AJ1W3Eahdk", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SumBasis/status/2115555964657291716/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115555961817706496", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/AJ1W3Eahdk"}, {"display_url": "x.com/WatcherGuru/st…", "end": 326, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/WatcherGuru/status/2115499686933192965", "start": 303, "url": "https://t.co/Lg9ZTCQqpa"}]}, "id": "2115555964657291716", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 126, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115499686933192965", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Measured like a token, the dollar has a 99.4% market share on-chain, and the Treasury Secretary says stablecoins can make it stronger.\n\nSome thoughts on stablecoins and the dollar.\n\nQuick numbers. DefiLlama counts $304 billion of stablecoins today, and $302.5 billion of that is https://t.co/AJ1W3Eahdk https://t.co/Lg9ZTCQqpa", "url": "https://x.com/SumBasis/status/2115555964657291716"}, {"author_id": "1506977845205422084", "created_at": "2026-10-29T07:22:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115705861230428383"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 15, "start": 10, "tag": "RBNT"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/XHgIRfj0D6", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/MjB38/status/2115705861230428383/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115705854855139328", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/XHgIRfj0D6"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/XHgIRfj0D6", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/MjB38/status/2115705861230428383/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115705854838317056", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/XHgIRfj0D6"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/XHgIRfj0D6", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/MjB38/status/2115705861230428383/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115705854792224768", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/XHgIRfj0D6"}]}, "id": "2115705861230428383", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 339, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "REDBELLY  $RBNT\n\nAUSTRALIA’S \nTOKENIZATION FUTURE \nIS TAKING SHAPE\n\nAustralia is moving closer to a financial system where bonds, investment funds and loans can be traded and settled using blockchain technology.\n\nRedbelly Network has submitted recommendations to the Reserve Bank https://t.co/XHgIRfj0D6", "url": "https://x.com/MjB38/status/2115705861230428383"}, {"author_id": "1373382408083365892", "created_at": "2026-10-29T05:23:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115675916613652625"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/pabCfYphya", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/DeepWater_SI/status/2115675916613652625/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115675902344671232", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/pabCfYphya"}]}, "id": "2115675916613652625", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 41, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The October 28 FOMC headline said the Fed held. December hike odds stayed above 80 percent anyway.\n\nWhat the Committee did: on a 10-2 vote it maintained the federal funds target range at 3-3/4 to 4 percent and kept ample reserves. Lisa D. Cook and Beth M. Hammack preferred a 1/4 https://t.co/pabCfYphya", "url": "https://x.com/DeepWater_SI/status/2115675916613652625"}, {"author_id": "1007391444561166336", "created_at": "2026-10-29T06:34:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115693856846917735"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 137, "id": "914777926180200448", "start": 129, "username": "Bitwise"}, {"end": 243, "id": "17946674", "start": 231, "username": "Matt_Hougan"}, {"end": 261, "id": "1169470576680816640", "start": 248, "username": "RasterlyRock"}, {"end": 271, "id": "914777926180200448", "start": 263, "username": "Bitwise"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/Bitwise/status…", "end": 295, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/Bitwise/status/2115494114980458741", "start": 272, "url": "https://t.co/ppQSnxFBJ6"}]}, "id": "2115693856846917735", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1246, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115494114980458741", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Even after Bitcoin dropped 53.4% from its October 2025 high of $126,080 down to $58,717 in June 2026, Wall Street crypto manager @Bitwise just raised its 10-year Bitcoin target to $1.6 million 🚨📈💰\n\nIn its 28 October 2026 report by @Matt_Hougan and @RasterlyRock, @Bitwise https://t.co/ppQSnxFBJ6", "url": "https://x.com/ilmeaalim/status/2115693856846917735"}, {"author_id": "2005170605851901954", "created_at": "2026-10-28T21:22:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115554713966153905"], "id": "2115554713966153905", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 166, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I am trying to fine tune my AI recently... And I'm begining to be satisfied.\n\nRead until the end to see what AI is forecasting.\n\nHere is what it told me about the recent Fed number (I cutted the useless verbose parts) :\n\n📈 Market reaction\n\nThe Fed held its target range at", "url": "https://x.com/plombier_fin/status/2115554713966153905"}, {"author_id": "1735758249633202176", "created_at": "2026-10-28T21:11:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115551933792719112"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Q0FD2N1Cdt", "end": 241, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/elevenflo/status/2115551933792719112/video/1", "media_key": "13_2115531119542124544", "start": 218, "url": "https://t.co/Q0FD2N1Cdt"}]}, "id": "2115551933792719112", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 288, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Getty's DIP is priced at SOFR + 5%, 300 bps under the median SOFR-priced DIP term loan since Jan 2025. You can pull that in Claude or ChatGPT with ElevenFlo connected, along with the five DIPs over $100M\nsince August. https://t.co/Q0FD2N1Cdt", "url": "https://x.com/elevenflo/status/2115551933792719112"}, {"author_id": "1658853693775572999", "created_at": "2026-10-28T22:13:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115567538230731019"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 5, "start": 0, "tag": "SOFR"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/YhooY1ifNe", "end": 61, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Interest_Rates/status/2115567538230731019/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115567535881957376", "start": 38, "url": "https://t.co/YhooY1ifNe"}]}, "id": "2115567538230731019", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 14, "impression_count": 3488, "like_count": 44, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 15}, "text": "#SOFR futures yield curve, post-FOMC. https://t.co/YhooY1ifNe", "url": "https://x.com/Interest_Rates/status/2115567538230731019"}, {"article": {"title": "The 2014 QE PDF Is Not the Main Character in 2026"}, "author_id": "2206236368", "created_at": "2026-10-28T21:58:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115563814435627203"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2115…", "end": 77, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2115561709381230592", "start": 54, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2115561709381230592", "url": "https://t.co/asXJXLuAlU"}]}, "id": "2115563814435627203", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 244, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "We all have the tools to have more informed opinions. https://t.co/asXJXLuAlU", "url": "https://x.com/chobberoni/status/2115563814435627203"}, {"author_id": "929790542703091712", "created_at": "2026-10-28T22:06:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115565786026881375"], "id": "2115565786026881375", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Fed funds and SOFR futures still price another hike. /ZT rallied +4/32 and the 2-year fell -6bp through Fed Chair Kevin Warsh's press conference anyway, while /ZB sold off.\n\nThe front end isn't fading the next move so much as the path beyond it, with the 2027 SOFR contracts doing", "url": "https://x.com/SignalsinMania/status/2115565786026881375"}, {"author_id": "2401978440", "created_at": "2026-10-29T06:37:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115694470544883752"], "id": "2115694470544883752", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Macro regime check (shadow tracking)\nRegime score: 2/4\nMax gross exposure cap: 75%\nStressed: credit, volatility, rates/dollar\nLiquidity (experimental): Fed net liquidity 13w -1.9%, NFCI -0.49, SOFR-IORB +3bp\nNot investment advice.", "url": "https://x.com/Mr_Quantist/status/2115694470544883752"}, {"author_id": "2104156899151425536", "created_at": "2026-10-29T07:38:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115709754127347830"], "id": "2115709754127347830", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Banks are now selling pieces of a $3.1B loan that buys Nvidia GPUs for Zankore, a new AI cloud in Indonesia. Five years, priced at 3.3 points over the base rate (SOFR). Bloomberg reported the sale on 27 Oct.", "url": "https://x.com/secondordertkn/status/2115709754127347830"}, {"author_id": "2334765404", "created_at": "2026-10-29T03:59:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115654796346892432"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 259, "start": 254, "tag": "FOMC"}, {"end": 264, "start": 260, "tag": "Fed"}, {"end": 276, "start": 265, "tag": "Treasuries"}], "urls": [{"description": "The Fed held at 3.75-4.00% by 10 votes to 2. Long Treasury yields rose anyway, and overnight repo crept above the reserve rate.", "display_url": "alanlongbon.substack.com/p/after-the-us…", "end": 253, "expanded_url": "https://alanlongbon.substack.com/p/after-the-us-feds-october-hold-two", "images": [{"height": 800, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115654839531352064/J6qD3f3I?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1600}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115654839531352064/J6qD3f3I?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 230, "status": 200, "title": "After the US Fed's October Hold: Two Votes for a Hike, and the Long End Kept Tightening", "unwound_url": "https://alanlongbon.substack.com/p/after-the-us-feds-october-hold-two", "url": "https://t.co/PrczmhUXuo"}]}, "id": "2115654796346892432", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 830, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "The US Fed held at 3.75-4.00%, 10-2, with two votes for a hike. The bond market tightened anyway: on decision day the 2-year fell 3 bp while the 10-year rose 6 bp to 5.05%. And SOFR is now above the rate the Fed pays on reserves.\nhttps://t.co/PrczmhUXuo\n#FOMC #Fed #Treasuries", "url": "https://x.com/AlanLongbon/status/2115654796346892432"}, {"author_id": "469958176", "created_at": "2026-10-28T22:36:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115573542108758067"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "A coroner has found the death of Australian actor Richard Norton was triggered by injecting unapproved peptides, recommending the TGA consider tougher restrictions. ", "display_url": "abc.net.au/news/2026-10-2…", "end": 105, "expanded_url": "https://www.abc.net.au/news/2026-10-29/victoria-peptide-death-coroners-report-richard-norton/107320590", "images": [{"height": 485, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115506156630142977/3oH5cGhk?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 862}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115506156630142977/3oH5cGhk?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 82, "status": 200, "title": "Unregulated peptides contributed to actor's death, coroner finds", "unwound_url": "https://www.abc.net.au/news/2026-10-29/victoria-peptide-death-coroners-report-richard-norton/107320590", "url": "https://t.co/7RFHzZ1uUw"}]}, "id": "2115573542108758067", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 31, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Coroner recommends TGA review peptide restrictions after Australian actor's death\nhttps://t.co/7RFHzZ1uUw", "url": "https://x.com/markmorey5/status/2115573542108758067"}, {"author_id": "470337401", "created_at": "2026-10-29T00:19:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115599444481564988"], "entities